narrator: Your surroundings escape you as you reach through darkness for anything tangible.
narrator: You take a step forward, but something catches your boot. Is that a…body? No…multiple bodies.
narrator: You reach out to turn the closest one over but are shocked to find the bones immediately scatter into ashes…

narrator: You look at your arm which emanates a blue-ish hue and recoil.
